● design
  The design extends the existing layered Spring Boot MVC app (Controller -> 
Service -> Repository -> H2) without introducing new frameworks. A new JPA 
entity ClickEvent (id, code, clicked_at UTC timestamp) is added to persist one 
row per successful redirect. UrlShortenerService.resolveAndRecordClick 
